%% bdf.mbt plugin demo: the documented static Mermaid flowchart subset.
%% No sequence/class diagrams, no HTML, no scripts, no external resources.
flowchart TD
  Start([Start]) --> Parse[Parse .mmd]
  Parse --> Check{Supported?}
  Check -->|yes| Encode[Encode BDF]
  Check -->|no| Reject[Reject input]
  Encode --> View[View BDF]
  Reject --> View
